[{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":4},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":29},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":2},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":1},{"op":"ifFalse","to":12,"condition":["==",["v","f",24],1]},{"op":"background","image":"bg030"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",316],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"翌日，一整天都耗在了练习篮球上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正好可以排解渚不在的寂寞。"},{"op":"goto","to":903},{"op":"background","image":"bg001"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",316],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到了午后，我去古河面包店找渚。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg007"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"店里是早苗阿姨…还有一位客人。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn12e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「哎呀，冈崎同学，你好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"女性","text":"「你好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那位女性和早苗阿姨一起向我致意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「请问，渚在吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「她还在打扮中哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"打扮…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是为了和我一起出去吗…应该不是吧。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"女性","text":"「你是小渚的朋友吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那位女性问我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呃？啊，是的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"女性","text":"「是同学？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我们不在一个班，不过是同一个年级的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"女性","text":"「小渚她还好吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，可好了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"女性","text":"「是吗，那就好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「……？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「这位是伊吹公子小姐，她曾经是渚的班主任。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到我一脸费解的样子，早苗阿姨向我介绍起客人来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「初次见面，我是伊吹。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊，你好。我叫冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「渚的班主任…那是我们学校的老师？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「是的。不过我三年前离职了，所以只工作到冈崎同学入学前一年为止。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊，那就是渚一年级时的班主任吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「是的。不过话说回来…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这位伊吹老师笑着转向早苗阿姨。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「才刚复学没多久，就和这么一个帅小伙这么要好。小渚她可真厉害呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn12he"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「是的。渚她平时可努力了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"努力做什么呢…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「看来挺挑长相的呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我突然觉得气氛非常尴尬。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「是朋也君吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，果然是朋也君。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「还真是说曹操曹操到呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「小渚，你好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，老师，欢迎光临。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「今天是要和帅小伙去约会吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，那个，不是的…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「…啊，我刚刚说的不是，指的是我们不是要去约会…我觉得朋也君还是很帅的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"越说越轻，后来都听不见她在说什么了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那个，朋也君。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「今天下午已经约好要和芽衣妹妹一起出去了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那啥，没我什么事了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「对不起…没你什么事了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「用不着道歉，没事的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「女生在一起能玩的更尽兴一些。你们去吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「谢谢你的理解。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我要努力给芽衣妹妹创造一个好回忆。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「你的男朋友不仅帅气，还很善解人意呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊…是的…非常善解人意…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"能不能别谈这个。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那么，我走了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，我送你。」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg001"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"离开店面，渚似乎有话想说，一直回头望着门口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「伊吹老师的妹妹住院了…」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",303],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「咦？是吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯。２年前遇到一场车祸，之后就一直在医院昏迷不醒…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这是妈妈告诉我的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「本来她是要和我们上同一所学校的。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":202,"condition":["&&",["==",["v","g",2],1],["==",["v","g",32],0]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是怎么回事…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…我有种奇妙的感觉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我从没见过伊吹老师的妹妹…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而我感觉，我十分熟悉她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"甚至让我觉得，没能和她一起共度校园生活…真的很可惜。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是早苗阿姨说的…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我有些在意，于是追问下去。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「也就是说…你也没见过她吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的，没见过。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「但我总觉得有种亲切感。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是因为她是老师的妹妹吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…原来我们不谋而合。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng14a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，伊吹老师…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"伊吹老师正站在店门口。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「哎呀，是不是打扰到你们了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她笑着问我们。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但她的笑容现在看来，却让我觉得有些刺痛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「听说老师的妹妹住院了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「咦？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「啊，是的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「希望她可以…快点好起来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我也是…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「衷心祝愿她…可以早日康复。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":183,"condition":[">",["v","g",0],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"莫名其妙…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我到底是怎么了才会说出这种话…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然感觉到手心有一阵微热。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我抬起手来。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":159,"condition":["==",["v","g",32],0]},{"op":"set","target":["v","g",32],"value":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","g",0],"value":["-",["v","g",0],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":9079,"entry":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好像有什么东西正被释放出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（光…？）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是一瞬间的事情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"过后，手心能感受到的，只有阳光的温度。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"抬头看去，也只有一片春日里蔚蓝的天空。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「谢谢你们。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「等她康复后，请多陪她玩玩吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，好的，那是当然。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「那我告辞了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"伊吹老师谢过我们后，离开了这里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"手被握住了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，没什么。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…那么，我也该走了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"手松开了。"},{"op":"goto","to":201},{"op":"ifFalse","to":201,"condition":["==",["v","g",0],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想为她做点什么…明明是陌生人，但我却有这种想法。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是…现在的我什么都做不了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真希望有…我能帮上忙的地方。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「谢谢你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「等她好起来，你们要陪她一起玩哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，好的，当然了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「那我告辞了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"伊吹老师向我们行了一礼，便从我们身边离开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那么，我也该走了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也不能一直记挂着这件事情。我收拾了一下心情。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"goto","to":226},{"op":"ifFalse","to":226,"condition":["||",["==",["v","g",2],0],["==",["v","g",32],1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng14a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，伊吹老师…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"伊吹老师正站在店门口。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「哎呀，是不是打扰到你们了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她笑着问我们。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但她的笑容现在看来，却让我觉得有些刺痛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「听说老师的妹妹住院了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「咦？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgko20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"伊吹","text":"「啊，是的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「希望她可以…快点好起来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我也是…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「衷心祝愿她…可以早日康复。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":224,"condition":["==",["v","g",32],0]},{"op":"goto","to":184},{"op":"goto","to":226},{"op":"ifFalse","to":226,"condition":["==",["v","g",32],1]},{"op":"goto","to":188},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",29],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，我…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哈…去那家伙那里吗。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":235,"condition":["==",["v","f",28],0]},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，到了日渐西沉的傍晚。"},{"op":"goto","to":773},{"op":"background","image":"bg046a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",314],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「结果，从昨天起就没说过话了吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「没有，也不想有。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦…看来只要确认你过得还好，就足够了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「即便我生病要死了，她也会只顾着和渚一起玩吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别这么自卑嘛。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「才没有。我永远都是一匹独狼。无拘无束。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「算啦，我也知道你不爽她不搭理你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「在我看来，有个那样一个妹妹真是让人羡慕的不得了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「羡慕什么啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没有妹妹的人有这样一个疑问，就是会不会对妹妹抱有奇怪的想法。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「但对实际有妹妹的人来说，这种疑问只会让人打寒颤对吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「对妹妹怎么可能会有奇怪的想法啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「是啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，你真有什么奇怪的想法吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我是变态吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「毕竟芽衣妹妹是那么的可爱。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「从小就看着她，天知道…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，随着她渐渐长大，你开始有了『糟糕，真越来越可爱了…』的想法。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别擅自决定我的想法。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「在有过这样的谈话后，你会下意识地去留意她。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「到底哪里可爱了？…然后一直盯着她看…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「糟糕，真越来越可爱了！…最后还会这么想。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「才不会。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我不是说了吗。你早已经中了我的陷阱。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「所以说，这根本就不可能。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚咚。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"轻轻的敲门声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，来了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真，真的吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我想想…总之先让她进来在说…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「话说，这搞得好像我心里有鬼似的，真服了，哈哈。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这人真好懂。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「深呼吸一下…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好了…哦，门没锁，进来吧！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘎吱。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng13a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，你在吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"滚滚滚！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原从我的视线里消失了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，怎么了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，朋也君你在这里啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「现在忙吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，超闲的说。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这样的话…如果没给你添麻烦的话…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「能给我一点时间吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？要做什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那个…也不是什么了不起的事…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「只是想一起去散散步，聊聊天…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呵，没想到会被你会来主动邀请我。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng12az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「…可以吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「当然。我十分乐意。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「太好了。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg034"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",316],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，这么好的天气，正好去散步。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng25a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是啊，唉嘿嘿。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，我们走吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「话说，要去哪？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这边。往家的方向。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「又要走这条老路吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不走的话预定会乱掉的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「还有什么预定吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，没有，刚刚是我自说自话…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，是吗。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg033"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那个。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君真是超Lucky的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「能在休息天…和我这么可爱的女孩子一起散步。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"噗！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我猛地看向渚。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「唉嘿嘿…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「只是有点可爱而已…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嘛…如果一点都不可爱的话，我也不会和你交往就是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是吧…朋也君真是走运。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「Lucky的说。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这微妙的气氛中，我们一直走着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「话说，有什么目的吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng30a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「目的吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是…面包。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「面包？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「去家里，买面包。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「为什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「当然是为了吃。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你还没吃够吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「话虽然是这么说没错，但附近没有商店能买到其他食物。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没有的话，不买不就行了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，因为肚子饿了，所以计划好要去买。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「计划好？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「没什么…去买吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「快，朋也君，走了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"抢着走在前面的渚，实在是太不自然了。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg001"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「到了…要进去吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯，要进去。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「请问有人在吗ー」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这家伙进自己家还这么说。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg007"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「欢迎光临！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「原来是我家女儿啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，现在我是客人。是来买面包的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「不用买，白给你就是。反正也卖不掉。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，这样可不行。是耍诈。必须要付钱才行。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak18e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哇啊…怎么会这样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「只要是附近的邻居，这种玩意儿都是白送的啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「即便这样也要付钱才行。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嘛，知道你很顽固…所以随你喜欢吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「只不过…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「别踩到地雷哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「地雷是什么东西？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「不，那啥…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「喂，小子，你来告诉她。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我不知道。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak12e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你骗谁啊！你怎么可能会不知道呢！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「天知道。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「这家伙，装什么乖宝宝！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「坏话全都要由我来说吗！！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「如果不想说的话，不说不就行了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak12e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「不说的话…万一渚踩到了地雷，怎么办？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「她没这么蠢吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「不，那真不好说…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「所以，我要说…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak12e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「渚啊…所谓的地雷…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「就是早苗烤出来的面包ーーーーーーー！！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也用不着这么大声喊出来吧。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"踏踏踏踏…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从走廊传来脚步声。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「我的面包…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「原来是古河面包店的地雷啊ーー！！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哭着跑回了屋里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是个大忙人。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak25e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「我的错？是我不好吗ーーー！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这种事连幼儿园的学生都知道。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak12e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你这家伙也一起叼着早苗的面包跑起来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「才不要。话说你还不去追？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「可恶。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一口气将好几个面包塞在嘴里…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「我最喜欢了ーーーー！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正想跑起来去追早苗阿姨的时候。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，爸爸。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被渚叫住了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak18e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嗯…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将面包从嘴里抽出来。真脏死了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「什么事，女儿啊…爸爸现在很忙的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"你倒是忙一下工作啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我要买面包，所以请你等一等。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「啊，哦…是有这么一回事。那你快点。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，来买面包吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚拿来托盘与夹子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng30a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我看看…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我想要买肉桂面包卷。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你喜欢就好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将一个那种面包放入托盘后，拿到大叔那里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我要买这个。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「好嘞。１２０日元。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚转向我这边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那个…请你来付钱。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啥…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你没带钱吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我带了。但我想让朋也君帮我付钱。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过…是你要吃的吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「没错。是我要的面包。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「然后要我付钱？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这样…不行…吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「倒不是说不行。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"拿出钱包，递给大叔一些零钱。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊…让朋也君帮买东西了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊…但没必要说出来吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「但是…朋也君应该是不介意的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「为什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「因为…是为我买的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啥！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"盯着渚看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那啥…能麻烦你再说一次吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不行…我不想再说了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那啥，刚才我没听清楚。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊…原来没听清楚啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那么，必须再说一次才行…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「可要听好了哦…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「知道…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「因为是为我买的，所以朋也君应该是不介意的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「是啊。能为我女儿买东西，你可真是个幸福的家伙。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说，你家女儿现在很奇怪啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak12e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你这家伙，泡了人家的女儿，现在又嫌弃她奇怪？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，怎么想她都不是说刚才那种台词的人吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak22e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嘿…这说明她变成熟了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「渚啊，去利用男人，利用个痛快吧！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我才不会做这种事情。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「只会对朋也君这么做。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只利用我个痛快吗…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「多掏点钱出来，混小子。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「回来前让渚变得光彩夺目。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我还是学生好吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「唉，真没出息…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我可不想被弄哭早苗阿姨的你这么说…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「早苗…哦，我给忘了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「已经够了吗，渚。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到渚的回答后，大叔掏出之前放围裙口袋里的面包，再次塞在嘴里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「我最喜欢了ーー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"朝向走廊那边，冲了出去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们只能看着他消失。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那个，朋也君。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我们也走吧。」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg037"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",320],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们来到公园，坐在长椅上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人看上去和平时没什么区别，但今天的渚很古怪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嚼啊嚼…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好吃吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是的…因为是朋也君付的钱…所以比平时的更好吃。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗。那就好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君也想要吃。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，别擅自帮我决定啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那么提问。朋也君也想要吃吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不想。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊…麻烦了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么东西。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她到底想做什么啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果刚才我回答说想要吃，才合她的心意吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看她一脸困惑的样子，还是说出来好了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我想吃。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng17a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「想要吃吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「但是，不给你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"滑。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我从长椅滑了下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说你啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「到底想要搞什么。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「你没事吧，朋也君…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没事…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我拍了拍屁股，又坐了回去。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「因为…只有一个。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「总会有办法的吧。比如说掰两半。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不，一整个都是我的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你一个人吃吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好的，我开始吃了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「但是，这样一来的话朋也君就太可怜了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「所以我想…让你闻闻味道好了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，是吗。那真谢谢了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然不是特别想去闻，不过还是这么回答算了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，请转向这边来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还以为她会让我闻面包，但我错了。渚是自己咬了一口面包。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嚼啊嚼…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仔细地嚼了嚼。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng19a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后下定了什么决心。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"呼ー。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"朝着我的鼻子吹了一口气过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那个…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「味道…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「如何啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我惊呆了，半天没缓过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不对…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我喜欢的渚不是这样的人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…身为男人好开心！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（喂，我到底在想些什么啊ー！）"},{"op":"choice","id":"6729:18164260","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"问她到底怎么回事","value":0,"serial":18164260},{"text":"请她再来一次","value":1,"serial":18164270}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":633,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那啥…这是什么意思？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你不是会做这种事的人吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「唉…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「被这么说…我真的好后悔…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「有点想哭…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不好…伤到渚的心了。"},{"op":"goto","to":685},{"op":"ifFalse","to":685,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「听我说…渚。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好，好的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不好意思…能再来一次吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「唉，为什么…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我屏住了呼吸…所以没闻到味道…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这样的话，不再做一次是不行了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，拜托了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又转向我这边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「还有呢，渚…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「气别直接吹，而是哈出一口暖气，这样能更好地闻出是什么味道。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是这样的吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「如果能更好闻出味道的话…我会努力去做的…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咬一口面包。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嚼啊嚼…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚似乎很害羞的样子…眼角已经含着泪了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然我很想去问她到底为什么要这么做，不过现在还是闭上嘴先享受一下好了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咽下去…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"或许是认为需要张大嘴，为了不让口腔里有残余的面包，用力吞咽了一下。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"话说，这样做了的话，面包的味道基本就剩不下了吧…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng19a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚把嘴巴贴过来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哈气ー…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鼻子吹来一阵暖气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一点点肉桂的香味。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「请问…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「刚刚的怎么样…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…有肉桂的味道。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「太好了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"暂时沉侵在余韵中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你不是会做这种事情的人吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「到底是怎么回事…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这种无法反驳的情况下，我开始追问她。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「唉…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「被这么说…我真的好后悔…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「有点想哭…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不好…伤到渚的心了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好好享受了一番后才说出来，确实有点卑鄙。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",30],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那啥，不是的。我说开心是真心话。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以，别这么消沉啦…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「好的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「但是啊，这一点都不像你…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不过…这应该…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是朋也君希望的才对。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「唉…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「所以我才这么做了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「莫非说，你…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真照芽衣妹妹说的做了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「虽然我的确有这么说过…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰！"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",314],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgme19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「好，约会到此为止。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从长椅后面树丛中跳出来的是…芽衣妹妹。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「渚姐姐，我们走吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不要，我要和朋也君说清楚缘由。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「要不然，我就成了奇怪的女孩了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「会被朋也君讨厌的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgme14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「啊，哦…也是呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「渚，你是不是被芽衣妹妹捏住什么把柄了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不是的，并不是因为有什么把柄…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「只是…有个约定…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「约定？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「没错，昨晚玩了个游戏。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「输的一方，要听赢家的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「然后，我输了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「于是，被说即便只是一天也好…要变成朋也君理想中的样子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「芽衣妹妹连要怎么做都帮我策划好了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「虽然有许多让人害羞的事情…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「但是，约定必须要遵守才行。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一半算是开玩笑的约定，明明没必要这么严肃去遵守的…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"芽衣妹妹知道渚的性格，故意这么做的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"让她做出这样约定的人，不是别人就是我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然是玩笑，但我还是说出了别样性格的渚才是我最喜欢的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"后悔死了…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，又觉得有点欣喜…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（唔…我真是个人渣啊…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…嗯，什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不仅说了还做了许多奇怪的事…真是对不起。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，别为这点小事就道歉啊。说到底还是我的错…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这么说，还会…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「…继续喜欢我吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「当然，我怎么可能会因这点事就讨厌你呢…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「是吗…太好了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「那我就放心了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"像获得了什么救赎一般，露出了笑容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，我想和你一起吃面包。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「一人一半，一起吃掉。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，就这样。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgme13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「呃…我是不是成电灯泡了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「不好意思，芽衣妹妹。我现在想要和朋也君单独相处一下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「吃了面包就回去，可以在家等我一下吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgme13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「知道啦，两位慢慢享受吧～」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"留下一个苦笑，芽衣妹妹离开了这里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呼…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「朋也君，面包。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「虽然吃过了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，完全没有关系的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「如果是和你吃同一个食物的话。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「真的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「当然。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「我也一样，很开心能和朋也君吃相同的食物。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…对。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两个人一起吃的话，不管是什么东西，都会变美味。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，夕阳西沉…傍晚时分。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg001y"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":3},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",315],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgme10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「多谢大家的照顾。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak23e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「噢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「有点舍不得你走呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「总感觉芽衣妹妹是自家人似的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgme19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「我也一样。感觉告别好难受。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「不过，正因为有了离别…才会有再会的美妙和激动的回忆。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「把和大家在一起的回忆藏在心中…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「从明天开始，一个人也要好好努力。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…你就没个朋友吗。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「芽衣妹妹…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgme16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「渚姐姐…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在一起时间最久的两个人握着彼此的手。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"互相对视了一会儿后…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgme11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「可以亲一下吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"芽衣妹妹如此问到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng13a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「唉？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgme10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「亲脸蛋。离别之吻的说。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「啊，可以的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「那么，不好意思…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紧紧抱住，把自己的脸贴到渚的脸颊上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「嗯ー…好可爱好可爱。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还摸了摸脑袋…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"等被她放开的时候，渚已经满脸通红。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgme10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「那么大家，就此别过吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看了看在场的所有人。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgme12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"芽衣","text":"「再见啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak23e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哦，有空翘课再来玩。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「我们一直等着你哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「有空别翘课再来玩吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「芽衣妹妹，再见。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她挥着手，一直望向这边…离开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"应该是去春原房间了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和渚特意安排了一下，最后让他们兄妹单独相处一会儿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果她直接回去了那就搞笑了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哦，已经这么晚了吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「今天也卖剩下这么多。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「好，该打起精神去发面包了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"你倒是打起精神去卖啊。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11he"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「请加油。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样的两个人居然能经营起这买卖。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后他们回到了店里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"夕阳下，只剩下我和渚。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们静静地站在一起。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":858,"condition":["==",["v","f",28],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"渚靠近我一步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后…握住了我的手。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「唉嘿嘿…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"多亏有芽衣妹妹推了一把…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之前渚从未主动握过我的手。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「请问，朋也君…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…什么事，渚。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们互相叫着对方的名字。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之前从未有过这么好的气氛。"},{"op":"goto","to":866},{"op":"ifFalse","to":866,"condition":["==",["v","f",28],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"多亏了芽衣妹妹…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和渚比以前更加亲密一些了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就算什么话也不说，感觉我们现在是心意相通的…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「请问，朋也君…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…什么事，渚。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们互相叫着对方的名字。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「现在起…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们的未来将…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「要加油练习篮球哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…你说什么？」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",314],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「练习篮球啊。春原同学不是说了吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没听说啊，而且现在气氛这么好，为什么会突然说起这个啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng14a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「气氛…好吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23az"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「这一定是因为朋也君对篮球的热情，和我声援你们的心情是一致的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…什么乱七八糟的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「而且，他现在不是在和芽衣妹妹说着话吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「还要再等一会儿。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「据说是要等入夜后。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「毕竟明天就要比赛了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「等一下带上点犒劳你们的东西，我也会去的。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":901,"condition":["==",["v","f",28],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「渚…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「在。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":896,"condition":["==",["v","f",30],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「拜托。哈一口气。」"},{"op":"goto","to":898},{"op":"ifFalse","to":898,"condition":["==",["v","f",30],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「拜托。哈一口气。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"渚","text":"「才不要。这么奇怪的事我不会再做了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…芽衣妹妹。我真的佩服你。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"结果渚，还是以前那个样子…。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":0},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":6430,"entry":0},{"op":"return"}]